UsageOverview
=============

This project is an independent, minimal left-edge usage notch for Claude,
Codex, and Grok.

Portions of the adapter approach, JSON response shapes, and UI patterns were
inspired by the MIT-licensed project:

  https://github.com/vinzdg/codenotch
  Copyright (c) 2026 Vinz
  Licensed under the MIT License

This repository is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or a fork of Codenotch.
No Sparkle updater, session busy indicators, sounds, or notifications are
included. Credentials are read only and never written.
